  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Set air fryer to 200°C. Cut potato in half. Using a fork, prick holes all over potato.<br>• Place potato on a large microwave-safe plate. Splash with water and cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave potato on high, until slightly tender, 5 mins.<br>• Remove paper towel and drizzle potato with olive oil and a good pinch of salt and toss to coat.<br>• Place potato into the air fryer basket, cut-side down and cook until golden and tender, 12-15 mins. <br><br>NO AIR FRYER? Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Cut potato in half. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Arrange cut-side <br>down and roast until crisp and tender, 40-45 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8422b6bb16e39e1b79c3a/step-2b1e5800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• Drain and rinse chickpeas.<br>• Finely chop parsley.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min. Transfer to a small heatproof bowl.<br>• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and stir to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8422b6bb16e39e1b79c3a/step-50288c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return  frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. <br>• Cook chickpeas until softened, 2-3 mins. Add chermoula spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.<br>• Stir in the water and butter and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Lightly crush chickpeas with a fork. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8422b6bb16e39e1b79c3a/step-b00cfa20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Add spinach &amp; rocket mix and toss to coat. Season to taste.<br>• Divide spuds and rocket salad between plates. <br>• Top spuds with chermoula chickpeas and garlic yoghurt.<br>• Crumble with fetta cubes and sprinkle over parsley to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8422b6bb16e39e1b79c3a/step-49b59630.jpg"
    }
  ]
